Package: alphaearthnemeton
Title: AlphaEarth Foundations Satellite Embeddings for 'nemeton'
Version: 2026.11.1
Authors@R:
    person("Pascal", "Obstétar", , "pascal.obstetar@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Fetches the annual AlphaEarth Foundations Satellite Embedding
    (Google DeepMind, 64 dimensions, 10 m) over an area of interest from the
    public Cloud Optimized GeoTIFFs, de-quantizes them, reprojects them and
    caches them as content-addressed COGs ready for the 'nemeton' package
    (indicator N5, spec 064). Pure R: no Python, no Earth Engine account.
License: GPL (>= 3)
Encoding: UTF-8
